# Li on boronized ST40 wall — minimal sticking model with a re-emission
# knob. A <R>: R = 0 sticks (ledger credit only); raise R for thermal
# re-emission scans (returns as neutral Li, half-Maxwellian at twall).

Li --> Li
A 0.0

Li+ --> Li
A 0.0

Li2+ --> Li
A 0.0

Li3+ --> Li
A 0.0

